WEBVTT

00:01:59.756 --> 00:02:03.716
that word enabled the brutalization
and racial genocide

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.916
of an entire group of people.

00:02:05.956 --> 00:02:10.356
It played its part
in dehumanizing Black people.

00:02:10.356 --> 00:02:12.316
What did "cunt" do?

00:02:12.356 --> 00:02:13.356
(Laughter)

00:02:13.356 --> 00:02:16.676
Does it not strike anyone else as odd

00:02:16.716 --> 00:02:19.636
that a word that just means the vulva

00:02:19.676 --> 00:02:23.636
could even be regarded
in the same league of offense

00:02:23.636 --> 00:02:24.956
as the N-word?

00:02:25.516 --> 00:02:29.036
Are we saying that vulvas
are that offensive?

00:02:29.036 --> 00:02:30.636
Surely not.